  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Mutual Injuries already ties Fang Yuan to wounds on Shen Shang. Light injuries on Shen Shang’s body also affect Fang Yuan, and because of non-conflicting dao marks those light injuries become heavy injuries. Shen Shang then activates the immortal killer move Heavy Injuries and starts to hurt himself, repeating the cast while he heavily injures himself and heals rapidly in a cycle. Fang Yuan’s body shakes and his vision turns dark. He judges that he cannot compare with Shen Shang in healing methods and needs another way.",
      "chapters": [
        1908
      ],
